	"this map.\p"

	"I hope it doesn't break.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_CodingCave {
	msgbox(
	"Did you find the Coding Cave?\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_HakariYes {
	msgbox(
	"Originally I was gonna put the\n"
	"Hakari quest in postgame, cuz I\l"
	"was scared it would be confused for\l"
	"vital game progress.\p"

	"Instead it spawns here after you've\n"
	"found the letter Y.\p"

	"This way every player will\n"
	"eventually see it, but it won't\l"
	"get in the way of progress.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_MashingA {
	msgbox(
	"This fight is sadly a bit lacking\n"
	"in sauce, but I couldn't think of\l"
	"anything fun.\p"

	"The dialogue pauses for like 10\n"
	"seconds if you say you're mashing\l"
	"so that people on Turbo will\l"
	"actually be able to read it.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_YesHouse {
	msgbox(
	"This has my current vote for most\n"
	"useless house in the game.\p"

	"If anyone can think of a better\n"
	"bit to put here instead, I'm\l"
	"all ears.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_GrandpaBread {
	msgbox(
	"The one bit of main-story writing\n"
	"that wasn't done by me!\p"

	"This was written by our animator\n"
	"Hakari.\p"

	"This gag was the sole reason I\n"
	"recruited him for the team.\l"
	"(cuz when drawing it, he remembered\l"
	"to set the text colors right)", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SewerSign {
	msgbox(
	"When naming this sign's script, I\n"
	"just happened to call it Sewer Sign.\p"

	"I was then compelled to make fun of\n"
	"how dumb of a name that was.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_RelicCastle {
	msgbox(
	"Rest in Peace, Relic Castle.\p"

	"Fuck Nintendo.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_DavidHasslehoff {
	msgbox(
	"He is David Hasselhoff.\p"

	"My placeholder NPCs are fun.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_999 {
	msgbox(
	"This is a joke for me, and me only.\p"

	"It's okay if you don't get it.\n"
	"I do.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Starlight {
	msgbox(
	"You would not believe how many\n"
	"times Starlight set this map\l"
	"to load the Volcano version as the\l"
	"default.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_StarlightCinnabar {
	msgbox(
	"You would not believe how many\n"
	"times Starlight set this map\l"
	"to load the Volcano version as the\l"
	"default.\p"

	"It was\n"
	"\l"

	"\l"
	"a lot.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_CinnabarFire {
	msgbox(
	"At first I wanted these to be\n"
	"shittily animated Minecraft fire.\p"

	"These are probably better.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_PlatoCloset {
	msgbox(
	"plasto is the coolest dev ever\n"
	"and he is not a idiot at all :)", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_President {
	msgbox(
	"I wasn't sure what direction to\n"
	"take with the President for a while.\p"

	"On one hand, your job is to save\n"
	"him from the DMCA.\l"
	"On the other, he's a billionaire.\p"

	"I like the compromise I made.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Palestine {
	msgbox(
	"As a rule of thumb, I do not talk\n"
	"about or reference current\l"
	"talking points or memes.\p"

	"I will make an exception here,\n"
	"because:\p"

	"1. 1948 was a long time ago, not\n"
	"modern.\p"

	"2. If I am to be “cringe” and\n"
	"“age poorly” in the future,\l"
	"then I'm proud to do it by\l"
	"standing against genocide.\p"

	"From the River to the Sea.\n"
	"Palestine will be free.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_SilphShortKid {
	msgbox(
	"There was gonna be a rehash of\n"
	"the short kid bit here, but I\l"
	"left it as placeholder up until\l"
	"release oops.\p"

	"I've now killed him.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_TheOffice {
	msgbox(
	"Starlight wanted to make this map\n"
	"look like The Office.\p"

	"I've never seen The Office, so I\n"
	"cannot say whether she did well.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_LarryFight2 {
	msgbox(
	"The number of people who see this\n"
	"fight and then go “Omg I can't\l"
	"wait for the fight to be finished!”\p"

	"holy shit\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SaffronFurrets {
	msgbox(
	"I put these furrets in Saffron cuz\n"
	"players kept forgetting to explore\l"
	"the city.\p"

	"Now, when they hear the Furret\n"
	"music they'll know there's\l"
	"SOMETHING to see here, so they'll\l"
	"actually remember to check.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SaffronGuy {
	msgbox(
	"This guy is right!\p"

	"That's how Saffron is programmed\n"
	"into the original games for\l"
	"whatever reason.\p"

	"Completely disconnected from the\n"
	"rest of the map.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_AvgnMusic {
	msgbox(
	"This gym is basically only here cuz\n"
	"really early on I made the kickass\l"
	"music for it.\p"

	"In the later stages of development\n"
	"I prolly wouldn't make an area like\l"
	"this, but hey.\p"

	"I REALLY like the song.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_BrunoDead {
	msgbox(
	"Have you found the speedrun tactic\n"
	"here?", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_CopycatDad {
	msgbox(
	"Copycat's palette sometimes got\n"
	"fucked up during the cutscene.\p"

	"I solved it by putting multiple\n"
	"copies of her and her dad off\l"
	"screen and invisible, so the\l"
	"palettes would load correctly.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Cals {
	msgbox(
	"This guy's HoodlumCallum.\p"

	"He's cool :)\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SkillSwap {
	msgbox(
	"For this guy's bit to work, I had\n"
	"to write a unique string for\l"
	"Skill Swap so you could see the\l"
	"ability you're getting.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_BerserkJeans {
	msgbox(
	"Possibly the greatest pun in the\n"
	"whole game.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Oversight {
	msgbox(
	"Why yes, I DID put that Celia there\n"
	"to block you in so you'd have to\l"
	"take the shortscut back.\p"

	"This was definitely intentional\n"
	"and not a mistake that I'm just\l"
	"gonna run with.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_BoulderWalls {
	msgbox(
	"These boulders are here so you'll\n"
	"always have Strength active when\l"
	"you interact with the captain.\p"

	"That way, you don't have to\n"
	"awkwardly use it from your menu\l"
	"instead.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_MegaKick {
	msgbox(
	"I put Mega Kick here so players\n"
	"would have to do the Captain part\l"
	"of Seafoam before Bill's Garden.\p"

	"This way, they'll see the cool\n"
	"around the world loopback at the\l"
	"right point in time.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Spheals {
	msgbox(
	"This cutscene took me almost a full\n"
	"week straight.\p"

	"If you held turbo through it, I\n"
	"do not forgive you.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_BrickBreakZubats {
	msgbox(
	"Using Brick Break with your Kanga\n"
	"in the PC does not buffer its\l"
	"nickname properly.\p"

	"Fixing this would be such a fucking\n"
	"pain in the ass that I have chosen\l"
	"not to.\p"

	"I'm sorry if this ruins your\n"
	"immersion.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_AlteringCave {
	msgbox(
	"This is Altering Cave!\p"

	"In vanilla, it was supposed to\n"
	"house various Pokemon from some\l"
	"mystery gift event.\p"

	"Unfortunately, it only ever\n"
	"actually hosted Zubats.\p"

	"I just locked them in.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Intermission1 {
	msgbox(
	"If you don't read the Berry Powder\n"
	"Man House Sign in Cerulean, you\l"
	"can't tell him the fate.\p"

	"Leaving the house will then start\n"
	"Chapter 7, Chapter 2, Intermission 1.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Intermission1Intermission1 {
	msgbox(
	"Apparently I already said that in\n"
	"the Cerulean City Celia next to\l"
	"the sign.\p"

	"I don't proofread this dev comm\n"
	"shit at all LOL", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Intermission1Intermission1Intermission1 {
	msgbox(
	"Please appreciate that this Celia\n"
	"was titled, “CeliaSecret_\l"
	"Intermission1_Intermission1”\p"

	"No prizes for guessing what this\n"
	"Celia is named.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_ThreeMinutes {
	msgbox(
	"Yeah you don't actually have to\n"
	"wait LOL", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_EonPledge {
	msgbox(
	"Have you found the secret fourth\n"
	"move this guy can teach?", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Unidentical {
	msgbox(
	"This was the first line of text\n"
	"I ever wrote for the game!\p"

	"Back when the concept was to just\n"
	"be Vanilla And Trolly Gyms, I\l"
	"wrote this Blaine Question.\p"

	"It made it all the way into the\n"
	"final edition of the hack.\l"
	"I'm very proud.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Eusine {
	msgbox(
	"This might be one of my favorite\n"
	"puzzles in the game.\p"

	"It's not hard, it's not even all\n"
	"that clever, but to me it sings of\l"
	"everything I wanted to do.\p"

	"I made a puzzle out of literally\n"
	"every established mechanic in this\l"
	"whole wacky, weird world.\l"
	"I think that's so much fun.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_BlaineFight {
	msgbox(
	"First pass of the design of this\n"
	"fight was that you'd need to\l"
	"have six specific Pokemon in your\l"
	"team at the start.\p"

	"Needless to say, that wouldn't\n"
	"have been very fun.\p"

	"Now it's an 8-stage game, and you\n"
	"can switch your mons at any point.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SecretAnswer {
	msgbox(
	"The first phase is intentionally\n"
	"the easiest to find the bonus\l"
	"answer for.\p"

	"This is to give most players a\n"
	"direct signal that the bonus\l"
	"answers exist in the first place.\p"

	"Good luck finding them!\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_TeamSky {
	msgbox(
	"Apparently there's a youtuber who\n"
	"did the Team Sky bit first.\p"

	"I want it known that I had the\n"
	"idea completely independently of\l"
	"him lmfao\p"

	"Some people INSIST that I'm a fan\n"
	"of his, when honestly it's just a\l"
	"silly idea we both had.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_ThunderArmor {
	msgbox(
	"There's a scrapped puzzle here\n"
	"where you'd fight against Swellow\l"
	"and Pikachu using Thunder Armor.\p"

	"The answer would be using the\n"
	"ability Lightningrod to prevent\l"
	"the Thunder from hitting them.\p"

	"This was scrapped cuz I didn't\n"
	"want to shine a light on that\l"
	"ability before Cynthia.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_PiscesGymLeader {
	msgbox(
	"If there's one thing people know\n"
	"about the Pisces soundtrack, it's\l"
	"that the Gym Leader fight slaps.\p"

	"I love how I could repurpose it\n"
	"here instead as a full blown total\l"
	"shitpost.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_OnixFluid {
	msgbox(
	"There was gonna be a puzzle where\n"
	"you got Cloyster by using the\l"
	"Gender Fluid with Onix.\p"

	"Sadly, when I decided on Onix being\n"
	"a final battle answer, I had to\l"
	"scrap the bit so you couldn't\l"
	"get softlocked.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Triangle {
	lock
	msgbox(
	"What the fuck is this puzzle\n")
	closemessage
	//goto(BirthIsland_Exterior_EventScript_Triangle)
	release
}

script CeliaSecret_CenteredTree {
	msgbox(
	"Behold, the legendary Tree That's\n"
	"Centered With The Player.\p"

	"Reblog for 200 years good luck.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_SkyTower {
	msgbox(
	"This was the final area I worked\n"
	"on in the hack.\p"

	"Originally the mystery dungeon bit\n"
	"was gonna be inside Zero Island,\l"
	"and Sky Tower was gonna be puzzles\l"
	"with cracked floors like Hoenn.\p"

	"However, we couldn't design any\n"
	"good puzzles with that bit, so\l"
	"we consolidated it here.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Kecleon {
	msgbox(
	"The Kecleon shops were planned to\n"
	"be much more expansive, and the\l"
	"Poke economy was gonna be more\l"
	"in-depth.\p"

	"I couldn't get the system to work\n"
	"how I wanted, so I scaled the\l"
	"whole affair back a bit.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_TrapTile {
	msgbox(
	"I made the traps do a little jump\n"
	"before triggering so that you'd\l"
	"be able to see the gags with the\l"
	"tile art before the effect.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Torchic {
	msgbox(
	"Alas, this was all that remains of\n"
	"the Torchic ass dot meat grinder\l"
	"minigame for nuggets.\p"

	"Farewell, Torchic ass dot meat\n"
	"grinder minigame for nuggets!", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerSurf {
	msgbox(
	"There's no in game justification\n"
	"for why you can't surf here.\p"

	"You just can't.\p"

	"I don't want to design this\n"
	"differently.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerCracks {
	msgbox(
	"I put these cracked floor tiles\n"
	"here as a way to subtly singal\l"
	"the use of the Bike here.\p"

	"They're not natively in Fire Red\n"
	"so I had to jankily mock em up.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerLugia {
	msgbox(
	"I had to pick SOME legendary\n"
	"Pokemon to be the one to turn into\l"
	"an item, and Lugia just happened to\l"
	"be one already in vanilla which I\l"
	"wasn't using elsewhere.\p"

	"Poor guy.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerTeamHeros {
	msgbox(
	"Based on a true story.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}



script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerSpiral {
	msgbox(
	"Mystery Dungeon map generation\n"
	"sure is fun.\p"

	"I designed the curve such that\n"
	"from the left, you can see it\l"
	"curve into the stair room, thus\l"
	"making you think you're about to\l"
	"finally make it in.\p"

	"Only to pull the rug at the end\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerTrapMaze {
	msgbox(
	"I wanted a second Pit Trap scare\n"
	"here at the end of this room, only\l"
	"this time showing the Oak you\l"
	"recruited earlier.\p"

	"But! No one really processed the\n"
	"tree on screen fast enough, so the\l"
	"joke didn't really land.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_SkyTowerNavelRock {
	msgbox(
	"Navel Rock is a well-designed map.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Loopbacks {
	msgbox(
	"My favorite part of designing this\n"
	"game was figuring out how to make\l"
	"the map wrap back around on itself.\p"

	"Thinking of creative ways to place\n"
	"you immediately back to where you\l"
	"needed to go without you even\l"
	"realizing it was such a delight.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_HubRoom {
	msgbox(
	"The dynamic warp system in here\n"
	"was a pain in the butt, since\l"
	"each room needs to update which\l"
	"hub the warp needs to take you to.\p"

	"Was it even worth it?\n"
	"Who knows.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Clover {
	msgbox(
	"Pokemon Clover has exactly one\n"
	"good joke, and it's the first gym.\p"

	"It's a copy of Brock's gym, with\n"
	"the Light Years trainer in it.\l"
	"Except, there's a warp panel.\p"

	"Then you step on the warp panel,\n"
	"and you're taken literal light\l"
	"years away for Brock.\p"

	"Excellent joke - Great setup,\n"
	"great payoff, no notes.\p"
	
	"Except!\p"

	"The Pokemon Clover playerbase is\n"
	"so unbelievably god damn mother\l"
	"fucking stupid that they cannot\l"
	"even recognize that a joke was\l"
	"being told.\p"

	"Instead, they laugh cuz Brock\n"
	"calls you a faggot.\p"

	"This apparently overshadows the\n"
	"actual clever, interesting joke.\p"

	"That's my opinion on that game.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Clover2 {
	msgbox(
	"And yes, the joke here is that I'm\n"
	"stealing Clover's joke, and the\l"
	"DMCA are mad at me for it.\p"

	"If Clover players actually knew\n"
	"how to read to realize that joke\l"
	"existed, maybe they'd get this one.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Yugioh {
	msgbox(
	"Between Demo 3 and the full game\n"
	"release, only two Pokemon were\l"
	"changed in the dex.\p"

	"One of them was adding Hoopa,\n"
	"purely so I could do this puzzle.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Neopets {
	msgbox(
	"Probably the least sauced DMCA\n"
	"fight.\l"
	"This was the first one put in.\p"

	"The original plan was to beat him\n"
	"with Zubat, since Zubat is blind\l"
	"so he can't see the Light That\l"
	"Burns The Sky.\p"

	"Then we tried having him be other\n"
	"nationalities like Italian or JP.\p"

	"I'm not 100% happy with where I\n"
	"landed, but it's acceptable.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_StraightPeople {
	msgbox(
	"Every single shelf has a unique\n"
	"style of drink.\p"

	"Additionally, the drinks are\n"
	"segregated left/right by manly\l"
	"drinks and girly drinks.\p"

	"Cuz, y'know.\n"
	"Straight people.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_MewBox {
	msgbox(
	"Shout outs to the youtube comment\n"
	"that said to make Mew (or Ditto)'s\l"
	"box icon the Brick Wall to match\l"
	"the Box background.\p"

	"Absolutely genius suggestion.\n"
	"Wish I thought of it myself.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_PaulFavorite {
	msgbox(
	"Paul is the favorite of all!\p"

	"If you haven't yet watched Book\n"
	"of Mario 64, go do that.\l"
	"It's such a fun experience.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_PokemonGun {
	msgbox(
	"This is, without a doubt, the\n"
	"hardest puzzle in the game.\p"

	"It's also the boldest and most\n"
	"risky, because I need people to be\l"
	"willing to go without new content\l"
	"for a while and just take in what\l"
	"they've already seen.\p"

	"I hope this puzzle worked for you,\n"
	"because it'll either make or break\l"
	"the game.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_AMew {
	msgbox(
	"Oh wow a mew!\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_CreditsSecret {
	msgbox(
	"Of COURSE I would hide a secret in\n"
	"the credits.\p"

	"Who do you think I am?\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Lucca {
	msgbox(
	"Shout outs to my friend Lucca,\n"
	"with whom I brainstormed the very\l"
	"first concept for this game!\p"

	"Incidentally, it also finished\n"
	"its PhD right in line with the\l"
	"Stupid Hack's release.\p"

	"I'm proud of both of us :)\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_LuccaPronouns {
	msgbox(
	"(yes. it/its. I will fight for its\n"
	"right to self-identity on this.)", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Pokedex {
	msgbox(
	"This here was the lynchpin of this\n"
	"whole experience:\p"

	"To beat the game, you must complete\n"
	"the entire Pokedex.\p"

	"Every other design decision I made\n"
	"comes back to this.\p"

	"How do you make a game engaging\n"
	"when the goal is to catch every\l"
	"single Pokemon?\p"

	"That was the challenge I took on.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_HMs {
	msgbox(
	"So hot take.\n"
	"I actually really like HMs.\p"

	"I think integrating the battle and\n"
	"overworld systems through the\l"
	"Pokemon you catch is clever af.\p"

	"I just also think Game Freak sucked\n"
	"absolute balls at using the system\l"
	"well, so people grew to hate it.\p"

	"Here is my answer to the kinds of\n"
	"interesting gameplay you can\l"
	"achieve by balancing around your\l"
	"party's HM restriction, instead of\l"
	"throwing the system out altogether.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_Growl {
	msgbox(
	"Growl being the field move for\n"
	"this girl?\l"
	"ENTIRELY a coincidence.\p"

	"Originally it was just so you\n"
	"couldn't release your starter and\l"
	"get softlocked at Surge.\p"

	"I knew I wanted the Starter as a\n"
	"Cynthia mon for Ivysaur, but my\l"
	"plan was for the move to be\l"
	"Rock Smash.\p"

	"But, I realized the Growl HM bit\n"
	"would be way more satisfying as a\l"
	"conclusion at the end of the game.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_TauntTM {
	msgbox(
	"Massive props to the few people\n"
	"who've figured out how to teach\l"
	"this TM.\p"

	"I hope it was worth it.\n"
	"", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Primeape {
	msgbox(
	"I actually struggled for a while\n"
	"over whether the Primeape here\l"
	"should be a pig.\p"

	"In earlier builds of the game, I\n"
	"couldn't be confident that players\l"
	"would actually remember the bit.\p"

	"However, at this point I know that\n"
	"Stupid Romhackeers are attentive\l"
	"enough to understand the point.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Cynthia {
	msgbox(
	"This is the smartest, most utterly\n"
	"cerebral fight I ever made.\p"

	"It's not particularly hard besides\n"
	"the Ivysaur phase, but for me as\l"
	"a designer it was a challenge.\p"

	"Each phase needed to feel good\n"
	"while I was also completely locked\l"
	"into the mons you had available.\p"

	"Seaking and Scyther's phases went\n"
	"through many iterations until I\l"
	"landed on the ones I'm okay with.\p"

	"It's not perfect, but what does\n"
	"work is darn brilliant.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Credits {
	msgbox(
	"This final battle was insane.\p"

	"None of this would have been\n"
	"possible without the immense work\l"
	"done by my extraordinarily skilled\l"
	"team.\p"

	"They deserve all the props for\n"
	"making my absurd, nonsensical\l"
	"vision come to life.\p"

	"Lichen's beautiful art, Wiz's\n"
	"batshit coding, Hakari's battle\l"
	"animation work, All of you did\l"
	"such an incredible job.\p"

	"Thank you for making this project\n"
	"a reality.\l"
	"I couldn't have done it alone.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


script CeliaSecret_JohtoLevelCurve {
	msgbox(
	"Okay so some nuance.\p"

	"I actually don't hate Johto's\n"
	"weird thing where some Pokemon are\l"
	"Kanto-exclusive.\p"

	"I like how it adds to the vibe that\n"
	"this is all one giant, living\l"
	"world that the player is only\l"
	"seeing one small part of.\p"

	"I just... wish they would've\n"
	"integrated it a bit better.\p"

	"The sloppy execution belies the\n"
	"inspired idea.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_Sequel {
	msgbox(
	"Somewhat frequently, people will\n"
	"ask me if I'm making a sequel\l"
	"based in Johto.\p"

	"I don't really know what to say to\n"
	"that.\p"

	"Celia's Stupid Romhack is already\n"
	"about everything.\l"
	"This isn't just a Kanto game.\p"

	"I used Kanto as my framework cuz\n"
	"player familiarity with it was the\l"
	"canvas upon which my brush worked.\p"

	"A sequel wouldn't have any meaning\n"
	"to it, so I'm not doing on.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}

script CeliaSecret_History {
	msgbox(
	"This guy has like 6 variations on\n"
	"his bad history, and they're\l"
	"all bangers.", MSGBOX_NPC)
}


